  "qualification": "44 new literal-rule constant-multiplier/fixed-TP settings and six separately labelled exact factor-ray line-search variants. The latter keep the objective/direction but change the printed step; they are not paper-exact adaFGD. No Armijo substitution, TP projection, or gate change.",
