  "schema_version": 1,
  "selection_rule": "Literal rule and variant ranked separately by worst-channel deficit max(RMSE/1e-6,normalizedTP/1e-3,max(0,1-fidelity)/.01). Any failed or nonfinite case makes a setting ineligible for success. A candidate must pass every calibration endpoint; tie-break by smaller total charged rows, smaller alpha, then smaller multiplier. Previous c1 pairs may be compared at their archived10k checkpoint only, with prioraudit/checkpoint recorded. A passing candidate is frozen before confirmation2..7; no retuning on confirmation or historicalrevalidation100..107. If literalnonepass, optionally extend atmost2bestfinite settings to100k only when trajectory diagnostics justify it; no unlimited blind extension. Finalheldout1000..1019 untouched.",
